---
import ProjectCard from '@/components/projects-card';
import BaseLayout from '@/layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title='Projects - Aldiery'>
	<section class='page-shell flex flex-col gap-8'>
		<div class='brutal-panel flex flex-col gap-3 p-5 md:flex-row md:items-end md:justify-between'>
			<div>
				<p class='text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.2em]'>Selected Work</p>
				<h1 class='mt-2 text-4xl sm:text-6xl'>Projects</h1>
			</div>
			<p class='max-w-xl border-l-4 border-[var(--line)] pl-3 text-sm'>
				Applications focused on scheduling, visualization, and workflow automation.
			</p>
		</div>

		<div class='grid grid-cols-1 gap-6 md:grid-cols-2 xl:grid-cols-3'>
			<ProjectCard img='/cmostatic.jpeg' link='https://cmo.aldiery.com' title='CMO Schedule App'>
				The CMO Schedule App is a web application that allows users to create and manage their schedules for our event based shifts at the Bienen Concert Management Office. It is built using React, TypeScript, and Tailwind CSS.
			</ProjectCard>
			<ProjectCard img='/classifier.png' link='https://classifier.aldiery.com' title='2d Classifier Visualizer'>
				The 2d Classifier Visualizer is a web application that allows users to visualize the decision boundaries of different machine learning classifiers in 2 dimensions. It is built using React, TypeScript, and Tailwind CSS.
			</ProjectCard>
			<ProjectCard title='We Have the Meets' img='/WHTM.png' link='https://wehavethemeets.wiki'>
				<strong>(IN PROGRESS)</strong> A schedule sync app that will link multiple different calendars for meeting planning.
			</ProjectCard>
		</div>
	</section>
</BaseLayout>
